            "value": "从键盘选择一个 emoji，或移除覆盖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pinch to zoom; drag to pan when zoomed in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "双指捏合缩放；放大后拖动平移。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pixelate": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "马赛克"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pixelate/blur on text can be reversed. Block is safest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字上的马赛克/模糊可能被还原。色块最安全。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Possible hidden watermark — will be scrubbed on export": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可能含隐藏水印——导出时将清除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Privacy Policy": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐私政策"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PrivyMark": {},
    "PrivyMark detects private info in a photo — faces, phone numbers, emails, names, card numbers, IDs, license plates — and redacts it for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PrivyMark 识别照片中的隐私信息——人脸、电话、邮箱、姓名、卡号、证件号、车牌——并帮你打码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PrivyMark needs access to your photos so you can pick one to redact.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PrivyMark 需要访问你的照片，以便你选择一张进行打码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "QR / Barcode": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "二维码 / 条形码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rate Us": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "给我们评分"
          }
        }
      }
    },
